## 📁 Repository Structure

```
geotopo_sts/
├── __init__.py
├── config.yaml              # Main configuration
├── requirements.txt
├── README.md
│
├── dataio/
│   ├── __init__.py
│   ├── preprocess.py        # Resampling, normalization, cropping
│   └── dataset.py           # PyTorch Dataset with augmentation
│
├── geometry/
│   ├── __init__.py
│   ├── mesh_extract.py      # Marching cubes, curvature features
│   ├── graph_build.py       # Graph construction for GNN
│   └── skeleton.py          # Optional skeleton extraction
│
├── topology/
│   ├── __init__.py
│   └── ph_features.py       # Persistent homology, persistence images
│
├── models/
│   ├── __init__.py
│   ├── voxels.py            # 3D ResNet/Mamba encoders
│   ├── mesh_gnn.py          # EGNN/E3NN graph networks
│   ├── topo_mlp.py          # Topology MLP
│   ├── fusion_head.py       # Fusion module & hierarchical head
│   └── geotopo_model.py     # End-to-end model
│
├── train.py                 # Training loop
├── eval.py                  # Evaluation & ablations
└── preprocess_pipeline.py   # Data preprocessing script
```

