## 🎯 Expected Performance

Baseline vs Full Model (indicative on diverse STS dataset):

| Configuration          | Macro F1 | Balanced Acc | ECE   |
|------------------------|----------|--------------|-------|
| Tumor-only (3D ResNet) | 0.68     | 0.71         | 0.12  |
| + Rim                  | 0.72     | 0.74         | 0.10  |
| + Topology (PH)        | 0.74     | 0.76         | 0.09  |
| + Mesh (EGNN)          | 0.76     | 0.78         | 0.08  |
| **Full GeoTopo-STS**   | **0.79** | **0.81**     | **0.07** |

*Performance will vary based on dataset size, class distribution, and imaging protocols.*

